How to Fix the DHT Timeout Issue in RL-Swarm

Open the script:

`nano rl-swarm/hivemind_exp/runner/gensyn/testnet_grpo_runner.py`

Locate this line inside setup_dht: 

`dht = hivemind.DHT(start=True, **self._dht_kwargs(grpo_args))`

And change it to: 

`dht = hivemind.DHT(start=True, startup_timeout=30, **self._dht_kwargs(grpo_args))`

Here’s what the updated method will look like:

```
def setup_dht(self, grpo_args):
    initial_peers = grpo_args.initial_peers
    if not initial_peers:
        logger.info("Cannot locate on-chain initial peers; running alone.")

    dht = hivemind.DHT(start=True, startup_timeout=30, **self._dht_kwargs(grpo_args))
    logger.info(f"🐝 Joining swarm with initial_peers = {initial_peers}")

    peer_id = str(dht.peer_id)
    self.name = self._get_animal_name(peer_id)
    self.register_peer(peer_id)
    return dht
```

